        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "I will give thanks to the LORD with my whole heart. I will tell of all your marvelous works.",
      "ko": "내가 전심으로 여호와께 감사하오며 주의 모든 기사를 전하리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "3cb91f9a6eb952141b883c0d71a0bd56ff80f988b347cafc7af58e277c001804",
      "translation_text_hash": "e62ad387ccb793eb86d8e0129c30229675ecf0515caa3786dd577b92652313d8",
