      "en": "The enemy is overtaken by endless ruin. The very memory of the cities which you have overthrown has perished.",
      "ko": "원수가 끊어져 영영히 멸망하였사오니 주께서 무너뜨린 성읍들을 기억할 수 없나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "8d11305f7be977a5b1a998b85e85e2a503dc5f50a4893b2a62f35b334328a520",
      "translation_text_hash": "3eb76ec20c28deadcad07f42e47d0311d85316ebb1f75c4a599b22fb6be5af59",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
